Z||000014||Robert||11-25-2000||06:07 PM||||KissMySSFiero:<BR>The yellow paint can be gotten at any good auto paint store.  You need to ask for 88 Fiero yellow, or I understand the same yellow is also under the name of 88 Corvette yellow. <BR>Hard color to paint with, wants to change color depending on how much thinner you use.  <P>Also you will need to wash your car at least once a week, any dirt will show just as well as the black trim does. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Good luck, and send pictures when your done.<P>Robert<BR>||||reg||1
